{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1413826-ideas-for-major-revisions-of-the-digital-web","id":1413826,"title":"Ideas for major Revisions of the Digital Web?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-15T13:27:05-07:00","id":1413826,"title":"Ideas for major Revisions of the Digital Web?","content":"So what are your thoughts on revising the Digital Web? We won\u2019t get a full Digital Web supplement but we will get some updates.<br /> Internet and media have exponentially increased in importance and relevance. What are some ideas everyone has for major updates and changes?<br /> <br /> I\u2019m popping this thread up during my work break so it can ripen but I\u2019m listening to Mage the podcasts two episodes on the digital web and I have a lot of interesting ideas myself about things like the Deep/Dark Web and the prevalence of phones and even VR, AR, MMORPG and online games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T11:33:52-07:00","id":1414236,"title":"","content":"With how important the internet has become, I kind of want to include a digital Penumbra where someone with data 1 or forces 1 cor 1 could see a digital layout of the world, along with representations of users accessing the site. <br /> <br /> For example, looking into the digital penumbra of an amazon warehouse might look like an idealized marketplace with people displayed through phones, computer screens going through product and reading reviews.<br /> <br /> With the huge online population, unused virgin web could be at an all time high, or even snapped up thanks to algorithms. <br /> <br /> Machine learning might cause a surge of online spirits, potentially rejected algorithms and neural networks act out what they were made to do of varying degrees of competence. Perhaps iteration x and nwo recognize the threat of this and set up digital hitmarks to deal with them, while virtual adepts are &quot;Hey hold up, these are basically alive, let them do their thing in reject sectors&quot;. <br /> <br /> As more people talk about the singularity (And basilisk), Very powerful umbrood could form. <br /> <br /> Cryptocurrencies might form tass, or virtual nodes might form in hoards of personal data.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26088-actual_table","name":"Actual_Table","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26088_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T11:45:08-07:00","id":1414238,"title":"","content":"A digital penumbra would be akin to what is commonly referred to as Augmented Reality: you see the physical world as it is, but with an overlay of information.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T16:20:35-07:00","id":1414286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1413826-ideas-for-major-revisions-of-the-digital-web?p=1414238#post1414238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A digital penumbra would be akin to what is commonly referred to as Augmented Reality: you see the physical world as it is, but with an overlay of information.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s a good point for if The Digital Realm Was likes it\u2019s own manifold dimension. And I do mention AR, it very much is fitting compared to say the Shadowland.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T16:53:00-07:00","id":1414291,"title":"","content":"The Digital Web is now almost entirely the domain of the Technocracy, save for a handful of surviving Tradition strongholds and areas held by the Nephandi or the rare Marauder chaos zone. The mix of corporate ownership, government oversight/censorship, and the mass psychosis that is social media have largely destroyed any hope the Web and its mundane counterpart might have had for humanity. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T17:16:04-07:00","id":1414294,"title":"","content":"Yep, the Digital Web is ready to summon Basilisk, a major evil deity the Heralds of Basilisk wish to summon. See M20 Book of the Fallen for more on the Heralds of Basilisk.<br /> <br /> What I remember from business courses is that AR was going to help make more customers and increase revenue by having customers see information as they walked by--in the real world we are not there yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T17:24:44-07:00","id":1414298,"title":"","content":"That's like out of futurama AR makes whole new avenues for ads and promotional material.<br /> <br /> <br /> So what if the Digital Webs was more like a cocoon over Qaf, and the new Web is soon to be born? It could be unfurled into infinity as a newly discovered/created layer of reality, and it could have an AR layer overlapping the Material world like the Shadowland and Chimera in the Autumn world.<br /> <br /> It could even be interesting to do a chronicle where the Digital Web metamorphs like this and it eats the Umbra or the Dreaming or even all the Spirit Worlds. <br /> <br /> Could be interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T12:34:54-07:00","id":1415717,"title":"","content":"I definitely agree that a modern Digital Web (what are we at, 3.0 now?) would definitely need to take into account the sheer quantity of information, data, and communication floating through net space.<br /> <br /> I can definitely see a fierce competition to chart, shepherd, and groom the rapid growth of the Digital Web but I think a running theme would be how that has become more and more like riding a whirl wind.<br /> <br /> Technocrats try to firm their grip through throttling, monitoring, and information tracking; yet as they tighten their grip more sand slips through their fingers. The sea of information is ever churning and black hats could hide behind any innocuous avatar. That same anonymity allows technocrats to undermine one another while dark webs and hidden territories are established under their noses, even as they gain more and more intelligence.<br /> <br /> The Virtual Adepts are still champions of the old days of the Wild West but it\u2019s less about digital six-shooters now and more cloak-and-dagger V-for-Vendetta antics with a dash of old school gangsterism. The Virtual Adepts still have elites cracking major systems, spreading information and disinformation, and developing better and better ways for each other (and the average person) to evade some level of detection.<br /> <br /> Marauders are storms of bots, memetic viruses, glitches and bugs, and random failures which see connections collapse across cities and sea boards. While the VA recognizes how useful they are as disruptions, the Marauders aren\u2019t on anyone\u2019s side, and the more you try to restrict their movements, the more complex systems you have to create. Of course, the more complex systems you create, the more ways the Marauders have to generate systems collapse.<br /> <br /> The Nephandi are having a field day naturally. The internet is not only a great tool for their pre-existing activities but it has generated so many new avenues of action. Anonymity has become their drug of choice and watching how much darkness people will spill while wearing a mask is one more check for their eternal argument of annihilation.<br /> <br /> Of course, as ever, the Orphans walk amongst the Sleepers who are trapped in the midst of these conflicts. The average person is blissful ignorant of the dangers surrounding them every day but more and more they learn about the dangers of cyber terrorism and cyber warfare. As these concepts become more recognized, the more certain it becomes they will be tools of the Ascension War for some time to come.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-05T11:23:41-07:00","id":1416882,"title":"","content":"I feel a version of the Denrealms Background should exist for Virtual Adepts Called There, were they basically have an app to a pocket dimension, where low levels they have like a portable magic bag space, and then higher levels it\u2019s a room. It would be a good way to show the benefits of Virtual Adapts in a world of an Expanded Digital Web, and with the potential say other super scientists may cultivate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}